OL,3,GNEWSA'My skin condition made me look
OL,4,Alike I was in a horror movie'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Josie North and her brother,
OL,7,FHarry, created their own party game
OL,8,Finspired by a house fire in their
OL,9,Ffamily home, it looked like the only
OL,10,Fway was up.
OL,12,FThe pair founded Hot House Games and
OL,13,Fco-created "Hit Send", a game that
OL,14,Fchallenges players to send risky or
OL,15,Ffunny texts for points, with YouTube
OL,16,Fcollective the Sidemen.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
